BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maddie's Secret
DTSTART:20260730T233000Z
DTEND:20260731T013500Z
DTSTAMP:20260730T233000Z
UID:hligwYA7XQ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nUnmissable directorial debut sat
 irizing and skewering content culture from iconic alt-comedian John Early\
 , who plays the titular role\, alongside a troupe of comedians including K
 ate Berlant\, Vanessa Bayer\, and Conner O’Malley.  From July 17 to 19\,
  all 7:00pm screenings will include a pre-recorded Q&A with John Early and
  one of these special guests:July 17 - Amy SedarisJuly 18 - Hannah Einbind
 erJuly 19 - Sarah Sherman\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/maddi
 es-secret-yr\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seattle 48 Hour Film Project
DTSTART:20260731T030000Z
DTEND:20260731T044500Z
DTSTAMP:20260731T030000Z
UID:pk24UfgRi9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nPresented by CREATE48 Media Netwo
 rk. Watch the world premieres of films created in just 48 hours by Seattl
 e filmmakers. The 2026 Seattle 48 Hour Film Project showcases original sho
 rt films spanning every genre\, celebrating creativity\, collaboration\, a
 nd the incredible challenge of making a movie from script to screen in one
  weekend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-48-hour-film-
 project\n\nEstimated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
